# Copy to `.dev.vars` for LOCAL development only. `.dev.vars` is gitignored and
# is never uploaded to Cloudflare Pages — `wrangler pages dev` reads it, deploys
# do not.
#
# This is a bypass of the Access sign-in, so it is deliberately awkward to turn
# on: BOTH variables must be set, and it only takes effect when ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN
# and ACCESS_AUD are absent. In production those are always set, so this branch
# is unreachable there even if the file somehow shipped.

ALLOW_DEV_AUTH="1"
DEV_REVIEWER_EMAIL="you@example.org"

# Optional: makes the dev identity an owner, so you can test delete-anyone.
# OWNER_EMAILS="you@example.org"

# --- notification (optional locally) ---------------------------------------
# Where the "Complete review" summary goes. Leave unset and completion still
# works — the reviewer is told plainly that no email went out.
#
# For local testing, point it at anything that accepts a POST:
# EMAIL_PROVIDER="webhook"
# EMAIL_WEBHOOK_URL="http://127.0.0.1:9999/hook"
